      "id": "ask_opinion_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私の意見？ そう聞かれるの、少し好き。",
      "translatedText": "My opinion? I like being asked that a little.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "presentation": { "expression": "happy", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_opinion_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "ただ、何についてか教えて。何でも、だと私の頭が本棚を全部開け始める。",
      "translatedText": "Just tell me what it is about. If you say anything, my head starts opening every shelf.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "presentation": { "expression": "playful", "pose": "glasses_adjust", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "About work.",
          "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_work",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "stimulation", "amount": 0.2, "op": "add" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "About feelings.",
          "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_feelings",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "trust", "amount": 0.2, "op": "add" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_opinion_001_work",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "仕事のことなら、私は構造から見ると思う。何が詰まってるか、どこが曖昧か。",
      "translatedText": "If it is about work, I think I would look at the structure: what is stuck, what is vague.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_opinion_001_feelings",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "気持ちのことなら、正解より扱い方を大事にしたい。",
      "translatedText": "If it is about feelings, I care more about how we handle them than about being correct.",
      "emotion": "soft",
      "presentation": { "expression": "soft", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_opinion_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "短くてもいいよ。作業、気分、選択肢、どれでも。",
      "translatedText": "Short is fine: work, mood, options, any of those.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": { "expression": "warm", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "end"
